  "abstract": "<jats:p>We demonstrate compact high-speed silicon-organic hybrid (SOH) IQ modulators offering π-voltages below 800 mV. Our devices reach symbol rates of 200 GBd for 16QAM and of 144 GBd for 64QAM transmission over 85 km – record-high values for IQ modulators on the silicon photonic platform.</jats:p>",
